Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:09.99,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(478,481)\shad0\fs24.5\pos(323,295)\b1\fnArial\c&H2E4074&\3c&HF0F3F7&\blur2}Lapis Lazuli Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.93,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:18.00,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is our graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:22.84,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,It's so sad to think \Nthat I won't see you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:25.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,We'll have opportunities to meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:29.59,Default - Top,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll always be here \Nin the Kingdom of Lapis Lazuli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.59,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,481)\fnArial\shad0\pos(324,287)\c&HCE99E8&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2}Tiararose Lapis Clamentile
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.59,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,481)\fnArial\shad0\pos(324,287)\c&HCE99E8&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5}Tiararose Lapis Clamentile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:31.33,Default - Top,Marietta,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:35.01,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,481)\fnArial\shad0\c&H8BC5D6&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\pos(157,297)\blur2}Marietta
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.38,0:00:35.01,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,481)\fnArial\shad0\c&H8BC5D6&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(157,297)}Marietta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:35.01,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,481)\fnArial\shad0\c&HC0B48E&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(484,297)}Fleuriane
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.38,0:00:35.01,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,481)\fnArial\shad0\c&HC0B48E&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(484,297)}Fleuriane
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:34.61,Default - Top,Marietta,0,0,0,,You are the future queen, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:38.23,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,When is your wedding to Prince Hartknights?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:42.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,After graduation, I'll undergo \Nbridal training for a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:45.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,and then we will hold our \Nwedding in the cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:51.14,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,Once you are queen, peace \Nin Lapis Lazuli will be assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.49,0:00:55.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I will do my best to live up \Nto everyone's expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:01:00.35,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I am Tiararose Lapis Clamentile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:04.08,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,the daughter of the marquis \Nwho was bestowed the Lapis name
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:06.07,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and fiancée of the crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:09.73,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.89,0:01:12.22,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:16.26,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,His expression looks somewhat grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.75,0:01:18.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Has something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:22.95,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.93,0:01:31.17,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:33.47,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:35.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,After all, I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:39.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.46,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:02:00.62,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
