Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:34.98,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,Sweet! A new event CG!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:38.41,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,And that's the Hartknights route cleared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:41.14,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The otome game, {\i0}The Ring of Lapis Lazuli{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:43.87,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\c&HAF88CE&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fad(308,1)\fs30\b1}The Ring {\c&HAFADA7&}of {\c&HE4A7A9&}Lapis Lazuli
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:43.87,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I loved it so much, I couldn't put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:45.31,Italics Top,Evil Tiararose,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:51.21,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEEEF&\frz359.9\fscx50\fscy7\pos(199.5,261)\alpha10}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
