Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:51.21,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEBEB&\frz359.9\alpha10\fscx133\fscy22\pos(308.5,283)\blur5}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:51.21,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs17\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HEBEBEB&\an7\bord3\pos(159,289)}You're just a lowly commoner.\NYou need to stay away from my Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:47.96,Italics Top,Evil Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're just a lowly commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:51.21,Italics Top,Evil Tiararose,0,0,0,,You need to stay away from my Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.59,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEEEF&\frz359.9\fscx50\fscy7\pos(199.5,261)\alpha10\fad(1,1067)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.59,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs18\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HE8F0F1&\pos(196,277)\fad(1,1067)}Tiararose
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.59,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEBEB&\frz359.9\alpha40\fscx133\fscy22\pos(308.5,283)\blur5\fad(1,1067)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.59,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs17\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HEBEBEB&\an7\bord3\pos(159,289)\fad(1,1067)}You're an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:52.53,Italics Top,Evil Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.77,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is that me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:05.39,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.19,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,401)}That was my previous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:08.19,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\c&H81708F&\3c&HD0D0D4&\fad(395,401)\fs30\b1}The Ring {\c&HAFADA7&}of {\c&HAA8889&}Lapis Lazuli
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:12.34,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,And that young lady \Nwith the nasty attitude is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.53,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:19.70,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,a villainess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:24.46,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I reincarnated as a villainess...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:26.54,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:28.85,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:30.45,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You should get some more sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.84,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I'm arranging a carriage for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:37.24,Italics Top,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Hartknights Lapislazuli Lactomuth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:37.84,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord1.5\fs16\pos(324,244)\blur2}First Prince of the Kingdom of Lapis Lazuli
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.55,0:04:37.84,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord0.5\fs16\pos(324,244)}First Prince of the Kingdom of Lapis Lazuli
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:37.84,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H97DAEE&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(324,273)}Hartknights Lapislazuli Lactomuth
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.55,0:04:37.84,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H97DAEE&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(324,273)}Hartknights Lapislazuli Lactomuth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:41.16,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He's the main route in the otome game
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:43.93,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and the first prince \Nof the Kingdom of Lapis Lazuli.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:49.69,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A character in the game I played \Nis right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:52.39,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You passing out like that is a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:58.03,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Were you trying to catch my eye because \NI was giving Akari so much attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:04:59.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,His eyes are so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:05.91,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He's nothing like the Hartknights in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:10.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No. I seem to be a bit under the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:12.82,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I apologize for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:16.21,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Well, I am your fiancé, technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:18.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,"Technically."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:22.93,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I know tomorrow is the graduation party, \Nbut I have business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:27.18,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I apologize, but I don't think \NI'll be able to escort you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.94,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:39.81,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is there any greater humiliation than \Nnot being escorted to a party by your fiancé?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:45.24,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But I know what happens \Nin the story from this point on,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:48.24,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\c&HAF88CE&\3c&HE8E4D6&\fs30\b1}The Ring {\c&HAFADA7&}of {\c&HE4A7A9&}Lapis Lazuli
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:47.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,because I played the game so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:50.79,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The main route in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:54.20,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,is the crown prince of the Kingdom \Nof Lapis Lazuli, Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:59.46,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The heroine enrolls at the academy \Nwith her powerful magic, the Holy Prayer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and meets Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:05.57,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He's the most popular student there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:09.37,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and he constantly showers \Nthe heroine with affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:12.08,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He smiles kindly at her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.87,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,whispers sweet lines to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:20.62,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and after the ending scene, they have \Na grand wedding at the cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:32.39,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But I'm not the heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:33.94,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm the villainess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:38.42,Italics Top,Evil Tiararose,0,0,0,,Know your place! You're only a commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:38.42,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEEEF&\frz359.9\fscx50\fscy7\pos(199.5,261)\alpha10}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.54,0:06:38.42,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,1)\shad0\fs18\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HE8F0F1&\pos(196,278)}Tiararose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:38.42,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEBEB&\frz359.9\alpha00\fscx133\fscy22\pos(308.5,283)\blur5}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.54,0:06:38.42,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,1)\shad0\fs17\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HEBEBEB&\an7\bord3\pos(164,290)}Know your place!\NYou're only a commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:41.13,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEEEF&\frz359.9\fscx50\fscy7\pos(199.5,261)\alpha10}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.42,0:06:41.13,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs18\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HE8F0F1&\pos(196,278)}Tiararose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:41.13,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEBEB&\frz359.9\alpha00\fscx133\fscy22\pos(308.5,283)\blur5}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:41.13,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs17\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HEBEBEB&\an7\bord3\pos(164,290)}I am a more suitable\N match for His Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:43.17,Italics Top,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Tiararose the villainess \Ntreats the heroine harshly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.17,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(2022,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEEEF&\frz359.9\fscx50\fscy7\pos(199.5,261)\alpha10}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.17,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(2022,1)\shad0\fs18\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HE8F0F1&\pos(195,276)}Tiararose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.17,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(2022,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEBEB&\frz359.9\alpha00\fscx133\fscy22\blur5\pos(305.5,283)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.17,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(2022,1)\shad0\fs17\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HEBEBEB&\an7\bord3\pos(161,290)}You're in my way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.80,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,because she doesn't want to lose the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:50.13,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,At the graduation party, she's condemned \Nfor her contempt of the heroine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:51.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and her engagement is called off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:55.77,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEEEF&\frz359.9\fscx50\fscy7\pos(199.5,261)\alpha10\fad(1,939)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.31,0:06:55.77,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs18\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HE8F0F1&\pos(194,278)\fad(1,939)}Tiararose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:55.77,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEBEBEB&\frz359.9\alpha00\fscx133\fscy22\pos(308.5,283)\blur5\fad(1,939)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.31,0:06:55.77,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs17\fnArial\c&H91989C&\3c&HEBEBEB&\an7\bord3\pos(164,290)\fad(1,939)}Grr! How infuriating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:55.77,Italics Top,Evil Tiararose,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,939)}Grr! How infuriating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:58.16,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But I haven't done anything that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:01.44,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'd like to avoid the condemnation \Nevent if I can, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.30,0:07:04.38,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Today is the day before the game's ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.60,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The condemnation event \Nis unavoidable at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Only a bad ending awaits me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:16.34,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What happens to the villainess \Nafter the condemnation event, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:18.96,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I do know this much:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:25.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,there is no happy ending where \Nthe villainess ends up with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:32.01,Default - Top,Philine,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:33.89,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H8BC5D6&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(472,299)}Philine Sunfist
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.01,0:07:33.89,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H7CBBBF&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(472,299)}Philine Sunfist
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:33.89,Default - Top,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Philine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:39.64,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The Lapis name is an honor \Nbestowed upon the families
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,of those who perform great deeds \Nfor the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:44.94,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.22,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:47.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:51.66,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What brought this on? \NYou rarely welcome me home personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:55.16,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord1.5\fs16\blur2\pos(199,203)}Prime Minister
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.66,0:07:55.16,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord0.5\fs16\pos(199,203)}Prime Minister
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:55.16,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H8BC5D6&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(200,234)}Schnauss Lapis Clamentile
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.66,0:07:55.16,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&HE9BDA3&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(200,234)}Schnauss Lapis Clamentile
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:55.16,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H8BC5D6&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(498,297)}Iltiana Lapis Clamentile
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.66,0:07:55.16,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H9E96D9&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(498,297)}Iltiana Lapis Clamentile
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:56.73,Default - Top,Iltiana,0,0,0,,We found a lovely accessory you can wear \Nat your wedding with the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:07:58.40,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,I was so excited to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:00.80,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,And we received some of the sweets you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:01.92,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Let's eat them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:05.68,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,You won't have many more \Nopportunities to eat sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:08.51,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,Now, dear, it's too soon to start crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:13.81,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,I know that. I'll miss Tiara, \Nbut her happiness comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:18.11,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,As the daughter of the marquis \Nwho was granted the Lapis name,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:22.06,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I've been undergoing training \Nto become queen since I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:24.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,As the crown prince's fiancée,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:28.07,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I've worked hard at studying \Nall sorts of subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:31.53,Flashback,Schnauss,0,0,0,,If it seems like your husband \Nis about to take a wrong turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:33.33,Flashback,Schnauss,0,0,0,,make sure you correct him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:36.15,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My father, the prime minister, taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:39.19,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It may have been strenuous at times,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:42.15,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but I did it all out of love \Nfor Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:47.18,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But... it seems that didn't get \Nthrough to Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:50.75,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I loved his character, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:55.59,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just skip \Ntomorrow's graduation party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:57.56,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:02.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It would be a bad look for the daughter of \Nthe marquis with the Lapis name to be absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:07.28,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The last thing I want to do \Nis trouble my dear mother and father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:12.05,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Hartknights' change of heart \Nis in line with the game's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:15.87,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't change my own role \Nas the villainess, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:21.00,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If I were the heroine, \NI could've had a happy ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:23.97,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but I don't know what's \Ngoing to happen to me now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:30.20,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:41.42,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:53.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If I could have my way, you would...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:59.95,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:04.00,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(1107,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\fs20\bord1.5\pos(320,293)\b1\c&HFDFDFF&\3c&H2B3E65&\4c&H529999&}The Day of the Condemnation Event
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:09.88,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,Lady Akari's behavior is simply too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:11.36,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,It certainly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:14.32,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,How dare she hang all over Prince Hartknights
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.86,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,when his fiancée, \NLady Tiararose, is right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:21.63,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, \NLady Tiararose, we're on your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:25.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you. That's very reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:35.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The condemnation event we all call \Na graduation party will soon begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:39.37,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I prepared myself for this, \Nbut I'm still scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:41.41,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:47.92,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should contact the master \Nand have him escort you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:50.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's all right, Philine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:52.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Father has his own work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:54.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I couldn't trouble him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:10:55.68,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:58.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Still... you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:03.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,If Father were to see me enter \Nthe party without an escort,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:06.02,Default - Top,Tiararose,0,0,0,,he would surely go mad with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:06.02,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(101,1)\b1\fnTimesNewRoman\an7\fs18\frz6.178\pos(91,274)}Excessively Doting Daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:10.15,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I'm still worried about you, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.03,0:11:18.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, those look delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.63,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Please, help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:22.12,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Gladly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:28.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:33.51,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I've loved baking and eating sweets \Never since my previous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:37.72,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Eating delicious sweets makes me feel happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:42.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine, did you bring these \Nto try to cheer me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:47.23,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I hoped it would make you smile, \Neven if only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.78,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:57.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't avoid the condemnation event,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:12:00.12,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,so there's no point \Nin sitting around being afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.67,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I have to try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:08.12,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Lady Tiara! Are you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:12.02,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Akari, you can't \Njust enter unannounced!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:14.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Well, good day to you, Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.83,0:12:17.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,And thank you for your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:20.40,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Good day to you, Lady Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:22.64,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H8BC5D6&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(528,272)}Akari
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.09,0:12:22.64,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&H8D77EF&\3c&H394487&\bord1.5\pos(528,272)}Akari
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:25.72,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure she's the heroine of \Nthe otome game {\i0}The Ring of Lapis Lazuli{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:28.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A cute, luxurious dress...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Shining jewels...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:33.36,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The sweet nature of an angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:37.05,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,She's everything you'd expect \Nthe game's heroine to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:42.16,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I was worried after you suddenly collapsed \Nin the classroom yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.17,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights was concerned, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:46.79,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,He's so kind, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:49.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I apologize for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.06,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Good day, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:05.38,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Of course. Akari was worried \Nafter you passed out, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:09.55,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,How are you feeling? \NWill you make it to the graduation party?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:14.06,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, I had a good night's rest, \Nso it won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:17.30,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,It's such a relief to see that you're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.57,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Isn't it, Prince Hartknights?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:20.82,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:26.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine, we'll need to make the final \Npreparations soon if I'm to make it on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:27.37,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:31.95,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,What?! Lady Tiara, you aren't even ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:35.04,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Looks like we arrived at a busy time for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:37.84,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,We'll be taking our leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:39.14,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:58.15,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Once these doors are opened, it will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:11.61,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Tiararose Lapis Clamentile \Nis entering the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:14.66,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.19,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Just like in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:22.68,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:25.14,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,Why is Lady Tiararose entering alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:28.26,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Who's that girl beside the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.19,0:14:32.52,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Tiararose, I hereby
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:35.40,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,call off my engagement with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:50.08,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Would you mind telling me the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.51,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,The reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:55.21,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Tiararose, why don't you try asking yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:15:00.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I don't know what could be. \NI've done nothing deserving of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:05.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,If you wish to take \Nsomeone else as your consort,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:09.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,are there not proper procedures \Nyou need to follow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:12.79,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,How dare you talk back \Nto a member of the royal family?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:15.58,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You said many harsh things to Akari
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.06,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,after learning that she \Ngrew up in the countryside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:22.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,She seemed to be unaware \Nof our kingdom's laws,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:24.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,so I simply taught her a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:29.69,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Well, I heard you told her \Nto kneel when greeting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:33.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Well, Your Highness is the crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:37.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It is common sense that she \Nshould kneel when greeting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:39.96,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,And you told her not to dance with me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:44.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That's because she had already \Ndanced with you more than twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.90,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That is something only your fiancée can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:56.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're not going to tell me \Nyou didn't know that, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:02.23,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,B-But Akari said you're always cruel to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:06.24,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No amount of defending my \Ninnocence will do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:11.47,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Whether it's because the heroine conquered him \Nor it's a revision to the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:13.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,it all goes according to the story in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:16.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I guess the ending can't be changed after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:23.86,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,So your heart belongs to Lady Akari, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:27.67,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You accept the breaking \Nof our engagement, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.89,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Then, I hereby end my engagement with you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:34.27,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,and will be engaged to Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:37.93,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,In other words, Akari will be the future queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:40.98,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:45.11,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But I still have my kind parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:48.04,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,as well as Philine and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:49.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I haven't lost everything—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:52.69,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,The crime of harming the future queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:55.46,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,is not a crime that can be forgiven!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:57.12,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:17:01.76,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Therefore, Tiararose, I hereby \Nbanish you from this kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:05.07,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Banish... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.07,0:17:07.67,Default,Fleuriane,0,0,0,,No... That's too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.72,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't defy the crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:15.06,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If I'm banished, I won't be able \Nto see any of them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:19.56,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Not my father, or my mother, \Nor even Philine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:25.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:30.05,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:55.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Lady Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:58.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:02.16,Italics Top,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The first prince \Nof the Kingdom of Marinforest...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:07.32,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord1.5\fs16\blur2\pos(319,209)}First Prince of the Kingdom of Marinforest
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:07.32,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord0.5\fs16\pos(319,209)}First Prince of the Kingdom of Marinforest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:07.32,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&HE0BCA7&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(319,238)}Aquasteed Marinforest
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.39,0:18:07.32,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&HE0BCA7&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(319,238)}Aquasteed Marinforest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.55,Italics Top,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.34,Italics Top,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He's the main character \Nof the game's sequel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:09.68,Italics Top,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I fell in love the moment \NI first saw his design.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:14.67,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But I died before the sequel \Nwas even released.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:18.36,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What is Prince Aquasteed doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:20.16,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's all right. Stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:24.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You, in all your pride, are more \Nrighteous than anyone here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:26.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,and more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:32.42,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed, \Ncould you stay out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:35.68,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,She must be condemned for her crimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:37.38,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Condemned?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:41.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It seems to me that your words \Nhave been far harsher than hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:47.30,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Breaking your engagement at a \Ngraduation party, a celebratory event,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,criticizing a lone woman \Nin front of everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,and humiliating her...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:54.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,These are not things \Na crown prince should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:18:57.70,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Wh-What business is it of yours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.09,0:18:59.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It is my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:02.33,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:06.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Your engagement is over now, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:16.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, would you be my consort?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:17.94,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:25.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I have wanted desperately \Nto make you mine for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:28.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What? For a... long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:33.32,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Wait, why is the prince \Nfrom the sequel proposing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.49,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Wait, he's proposing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:42.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sure my sudden proposal \Ncomes as a surprise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:46.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But would you please consider it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:24.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Hearing how you feel has made me very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:26.54,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:29.71,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:34.91,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Lady Tiara was Prince Hartknights' \Nfiancée until just a moment ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:37.22,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Why would you choose her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:41.01,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Lady Tiara is terribly mean and belligerent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:43.18,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,She isn't fit for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:46.35,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,So please... come and join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:48.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.09,0:20:51.22,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed is the crown prince \Nof our neighboring kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:54.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You mustn't simply touch him like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:56.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please let go of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:59.06,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,No! I won't let you have Prince Aqua—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.47,0:21:05.65,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you for showing such concern \Nfor me, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.45,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:11.33,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I am the first prince of Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:14.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You know this, and you still \Nchoose to behave this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.13,0:21:15.82,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:19.71,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But you are very kind, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.76,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You wouldn't get angry over such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:24.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,She disrespects me. Take her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:24.88,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:26.87,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,What?! But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:29.52,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:35.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It seems I've caused confusion \Nby suddenly getting involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.85,0:21:39.08,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I do apologize, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:43.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not at all. \NI should thank you for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.35,0:21:46.78,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I would help you at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:53.00,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,We should be past the game's ending already...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.38,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What's going to happen now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\pos(325,123)\blur4\bord1}Prince Aqua,{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Do You Like {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Sugar{\b0}{\c&H343E6B&}?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\pos(325,123)\bord1.75}Prince Aqua,{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Do You Like {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Sugar{\b0}{\c&H343E6B&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:35.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I never dreamed Prince Aquasteed \Nwould propose to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:39.05,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please don't spoil me so.
